vue"," files still works.",[254,519,521],{"id":520},"notes-on-using-nuxt-ui","Notes on using Nuxt UI",[523,524,525,537,556],"ul",{},[526,527,528,529,532,533,536],"li",{},"Your project CSS must include ",[287,530,531],{},"@import '@shuo\u002Fui\u002Fcss';"," (after ",[287,534,535],{},"@import 'tailwindcss'","). Otherwise Tailwind does not scan the classes inside the component library and some styles are missing.",[526,538,539,540,543,544,547,548,550,551,555],{},"Wrap form fields in ",[287,541,542],{},"UFormField"," with a ",[287,545,546],{},"name",". The component then picks up the id, name, size, disabled and error state of ",[287,549,542],{},", and triggers validation on input, blur and change. See ",[307,552,554],{"href":553},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#size-and-uformfield","Size and UFormField"," for the size precedence.",[526,557,558,559,562,563,566,567,570,571,574,575,578,579,582],{},"Icons use Iconify (",[287,560,561],{},"i-lucide-*","). Icons used by the component library, and icons set in ",[287,564,565],{},"shuoUi.components",", are added to the ",[287,568,569],{},"@nuxt\u002Ficon"," client bundle by the module automatically. Other icons passed as props in your pages must be added to ",[287,572,573],{},"icon.clientBundle.icons"," yourself, or keep the runtime icon API. If your project disables the runtime icon API (",[287,576,577],{},"icon.provider: 'none'","), install ",[287,580,581],{},"@iconify-json\u002Flucide"," so the icons can be bundled at build time.",[584,585,586],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8